# quantity  mode  [C, floor in units of machine epsilon]
# common envelope with implicit radiation: self-gravity + 2 sinks, global timesteps
# total energy changes through the implicit gas-radiation exchange, so it is compared to the reference.
# the treecode conserves linear and angular momentum exactly, so these are enforced to round-off
# (they are constant to the precision of the .ev file in the reference run).
# The centre of mass moves uniformly and is checked after removing that motion, with the same
# allowance for round-off in summing m*x over 2e6 particles as the commonenv benchmark.
etot   ref
totmom exact
angtot exact
xcom   exact 5e6
ycom   exact 5e6
zcom   exact 5e6
